(6829153, 1027208, 138253, '<td valign="top">I debated writing a longer post about how stating humans are the only things with souls on this planet is like saying we''re the only intelligent life in the universe, but then i decided to just write a short bit.<br/>Anyways, technically it''s not a bad image, but i do feel there''s a tad too much sky here. I print-screened/cropped out about 1/3 to 1/2 of your sky and a tad on the bottom to give it a more panoramic feel and personally liked that feeling better, given the mountainous background.</td>', 'I debated writing a longer post about how stating humans are the only things with souls on this planet is like saying we''re the only intelligent life in the universe, but then i decided to just write a short bit.Anyways, technically it''s not a bad image, but i do feel there''s a tad too much sky here. I print-screened/cropped out about 1/3 to 1/2 of your sky and a tad on the bottom to give it a more panoramic feel and personally liked that feeling better, given the mountainous background.', '2012-07-27 14:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
