(6830211, 1026742, 143098, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here but my eye is having a hard time seperating the background from the subject.  That may have been your intention so I won''t say its wrong just has a very camoflauged feel to it.</td>', 'I like the idea here but my eye is having a hard time seperating the background from the subject.  That may have been your intention so I won''t say its wrong just has a very camoflauged feel to it.', '2012-07-29 21:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830212, 1026480, 143098, '<td valign="top">nice muted tones along with the swirly black clouds gives this a very apocalyptic feel IMO. nice shot.</td>', 'nice muted tones along with the swirly black clouds gives this a very apocalyptic feel IMO. nice shot.', '2012-07-29 21:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830214, 1027251, 143098, '<td valign="top">cute shot...like the contrast between the green dress and the rather bland wall...nice job.</td>', 'cute shot...like the contrast between the green dress and the rather bland wall...nice job.', '2012-07-29 21:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830216, 1027288, 143098, '<td valign="top">Like the amount of negative space in this shot..this shot as a whole really emphasizes the title with it simplicity.  Also like the subtle grain in the PP. Nice work. (bumping)</td>', 'Like the amount of negative space in this shot..this shot as a whole really emphasizes the title with it simplicity.  Also like the subtle grain in the PP. Nice work. (bumping)', '2012-07-29 21:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830489, 1027299, 40391, '<td valign="top">Wonderful and thought provoking.</td>', 'Wonderful and thought provoking.', '2012-07-30 06:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830490, 1026653, 40391, '<td valign="top">It might only be me but I do see a profile of a face in the clouds. Great capture!</td>', 'It might only be me but I do see a profile of a face in the clouds. Great capture!', '2012-07-30 06:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830491, 1027207, 40391, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting and textures</td>', 'Wonderful lighting and textures', '2012-07-30 06:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830492, 1026372, 40391, '<td valign="top">Hopefully more sharp than flat. Nice shot!</td>', 'Hopefully more sharp than flat. Nice shot!', '2012-07-30 06:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830723, 1026925, 12611, '<td valign="top">very well done. the blue greens are lush, the grain and the silhouette, perfect.</td>', 'very well done. the blue greens are lush, the grain and the silhouette, perfect.', '2012-07-30 14:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830736, 1026779, 12611, '<td valign="top">and the good light.</td>', 'and the good light.', '2012-07-30 14:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830781, 1026638, 12611, '<td valign="top">more like sauced and lying on the street. great processing and good for a laugh.</td>', 'more like sauced and lying on the street. great processing and good for a laugh.', '2012-07-30 15:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830971, 1026459, 64929, '<td valign="top">Love this shot!  *9*</td>', 'Love this shot!  *9*', '2012-07-30 19:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830972, 1027246, 64929, '<td valign="top">Simply lovely!  *8*</td>', 'Simply lovely!  *8*', '2012-07-30 19:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6830973, 1027261, 64929, '<td valign="top">So colorful &amp; whimsical!  Love it!  *8*</td>', 'So colorful & whimsical!  Love it!  *8*', '2012-07-30 19:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831015, 1026779, 132305, '<td valign="top">This is a winner.</td>', 'This is a winner.', '2012-07-30 21:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831124, 1027214, 15511, '<td valign="top">Actually, braking - hard.</td>', 'Actually, braking - hard.', '2012-07-31 00:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831132, 1027058, 30982, '<td valign="top">Maybe, but also supremely confident and not just a wee bit clever.  Yes?  (That''s how I read it, anyway!)</td>', 'Maybe, but also supremely confident and not just a wee bit clever.  Yes?  (That''s how I read it, anyway!)', '2012-07-31 00:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831133, 1027026, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ha ha!  A bit odd, for sure.  It appears someone has written something on your waist?  Looks a bit faded/desaturated - I might prefer it either fully in color or fully in B&amp;W.  Sometimes the halfway works but other times it just feels a bit contrived to me.</td>', 'Ha ha!  A bit odd, for sure.  It appears someone has written something on your waist?  Looks a bit faded/desaturated - I might prefer it either fully in color or fully in B&W.  Sometimes the halfway works but other times it just feels a bit contrived to me.', '2012-07-31 00:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831134, 1027249, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''d say you''re reserved and very nicely balanced based on this.</td>', 'I''d say you''re reserved and very nicely balanced based on this.', '2012-07-31 00:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831135, 1027020, 30982, '<td valign="top">I would assume you''re a birder at heart, or at least a nature photographer.  Nice pose from your subject!</td>', 'I would assume you''re a birder at heart, or at least a nature photographer.  Nice pose from your subject!', '2012-07-31 00:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831137, 1026842, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the concept here but would like it fleshed out just a bit more, with a few more clues on the paper slips, perhaps?</td>', 'I like the concept here but would like it fleshed out just a bit more, with a few more clues on the paper slips, perhaps?', '2012-07-31 01:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831139, 1026499, 30982, '<td valign="top">From this I''d say you''re very shapely!</td>', 'From this I''d say you''re very shapely!', '2012-07-31 01:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831140, 1026930, 30982, '<td valign="top">You must be a stargazer!  It''s fun to see the faces formed.</td>', 'You must be a stargazer!  It''s fun to see the faces formed.', '2012-07-31 01:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831141, 1026474, 30982, '<td valign="top">From this I see someone who really stops to see beyond the apparent.  I also see that your ship has come in.  Don''t miss it!</td>', 'From this I see someone who really stops to see beyond the apparent.  I also see that your ship has come in.  Don''t miss it!', '2012-07-31 01:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831142, 1027301, 30982, '<td valign="top">An intriguing graphic - from this I''d say you''re a very artistic person, who uses photography as an expression far beyond simple recordings of moments.  Nice flow and form!</td>', 'An intriguing graphic - from this I''d say you''re a very artistic person, who uses photography as an expression far beyond simple recordings of moments.  Nice flow and form!', '2012-07-31 01:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831143, 1027246, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''d guess you''re the kind of person who loves the intricacies and colors of nature.  Lovely bloom!</td>', 'I''d guess you''re the kind of person who loves the intricacies and colors of nature.  Lovely bloom!', '2012-07-31 01:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831157, 1027079, 30982, '<td valign="top">But there''s no coffee!  I can relate to the morning java, though, even though mine tends to be decaf.  Nice upbeat feel to this.</td>', 'But there''s no coffee!  I can relate to the morning java, though, even though mine tends to be decaf.  Nice upbeat feel to this.', '2012-07-31 01:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831181, 1027153, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ah, you must be a foodie!  Very pretty dish.</td>', 'Ah, you must be a foodie!  Very pretty dish.', '2012-07-31 02:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831183, 1027275, 30982, '<td valign="top">You must be a poet in addition to a photographer.  I like the subtle nuances of shading here.</td>', 'You must be a poet in addition to a photographer.  I like the subtle nuances of shading here.', '2012-07-31 02:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831184, 1027299, 30982, '<td valign="top">This could be read as somewhat despondent or stubbornly strong and determined.  I much prefer the latter.  This shot has considerable power.</td>', 'This could be read as somewhat despondent or stubbornly strong and determined.  I much prefer the latter.  This shot has considerable power.', '2012-07-31 02:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831185, 1027214, 30982, '<td valign="top">You''re a city dweller who''s always on the move.  Nice blur!</td>', 'You''re a city dweller who''s always on the move.  Nice blur!', '2012-07-31 02:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831187, 1027207, 30982, '<td valign="top">You live life fully, quietly, and at peace with your surroundings.  Lovely collection of textures and tones here.</td>', 'You live life fully, quietly, and at peace with your surroundings.  Lovely collection of textures and tones here.', '2012-07-31 02:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831190, 1026372, 30982, '<td valign="top">I get the impression you like to dabble in music - it plays a part in your life.  I like the angle/perspective here.</td>', 'I get the impression you like to dabble in music - it plays a part in your life.  I like the angle/perspective here.', '2012-07-31 02:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831191, 1026742, 30982, '<td valign="top">You''re a busy soul - you see things all around you and seek out the smallest of details.  I love how this is almost a where''s waldo with the camera!</td>', 'You''re a busy soul - you see things all around you and seek out the smallest of details.  I love how this is almost a where''s waldo with the camera!', '2012-07-31 02:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831192, 1026653, 30982, '<td valign="top">From this photo, I''d assume you''re a spiritual person and that part of you drives much of what you do.</td>', 'From this photo, I''d assume you''re a spiritual person and that part of you drives much of what you do.', '2012-07-31 02:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831195, 1027304, 30982, '<td valign="top">Hmm... You see yourself as pear-shaped?  :-)</td>', 'Hmm... You see yourself as pear-shaped?  :-)', '2012-07-31 02:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831196, 1027243, 30982, '<td valign="top">Looks like an Alessandro kind of shot.</td>', 'Looks like an Alessandro kind of shot.', '2012-07-31 02:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831197, 1026667, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ha!  So you see yourself as a tad bottom heavy?  I think you''re probably being overly critical.  The shot is lovely!</td>', 'Ha!  So you see yourself as a tad bottom heavy?  I think you''re probably being overly critical.  The shot is lovely!', '2012-07-31 02:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831198, 1027120, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ha!  Nice still life.  Pretty sure I don''twant to meet up with you in a dark alley...</td>', 'Ha!  Nice still life.  Pretty sure I don''twant to meet up with you in a dark alley...', '2012-07-31 02:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831199, 1027281, 30982, '<td valign="top">Has a dreary feel to it to go with your frowny-face title.  A bit crisper focus would be good - though that might pull away from the feel of this a bit.  Were you shooting with a low shutter speed?</td>', 'Has a dreary feel to it to go with your frowny-face title.  A bit crisper focus would be good - though that might pull away from the feel of this a bit.  Were you shooting with a low shutter speed?', '2012-07-31 02:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831200, 1027185, 30982, '<td valign="top">Maybe a bit busy, but I like the way you set everything out and lit them individually.  Flashlight, perhaps?  I''ll have to come back after the challenge to get all the explanations!</td>', 'Maybe a bit busy, but I like the way you set everything out and lit them individually.  Flashlight, perhaps?  I''ll have to come back after the challenge to get all the explanations!', '2012-07-31 02:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831232, 1027218, 131419, '<td valign="top">I really like this, it makes me smile, well done</td>', 'I really like this, it makes me smile, well done', '2012-07-31 03:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831233, 1026459, 131419, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous, and a good one at that!</td>', 'Gorgeous, and a good one at that!', '2012-07-31 03:24:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6831234, 1027185, 131419, '<td valign="top">really cool, well done</td>', 'really cool, well done', '2012-07-31 03:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831235, 1027298, 131419, '<td valign="top">Beautiful contrasts, and strong statement</td>', 'Beautiful contrasts, and strong statement', '2012-07-31 03:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831238, 1026372, 131419, '<td valign="top">Great composition</td>', 'Great composition', '2012-07-31 03:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831519, 1026480, 142473, '<td valign="top">Well this certainly stands out.  Nicely done, with a well matched title.</td>', 'Well this certainly stands out.  Nicely done, with a well matched title.', '2012-07-31 14:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831525, 1027269, 142473, '<td valign="top">I like where you''re going with this shot... but it''s lacking focus.  What might have gone better was a more macro shot, showing only essences of your different pieces.  Get only the classic jeep grille, maybe the front of the metal detector propped up against the grile.  The camera can be sitting on the bumper, the ski creating an interesting X element on the other side of the grille.  Maybe the backpack sitting on top of the hood with a few straps hanging down into the frame.  I liked that you tried to get all of your hobbies together in one shot, but the problem is the overemphasis of the jeep.  It looks like a picture of the jeep (from a bad angle), with a few random things leaning on it.  Cheers mate.</td>', 'I like where you''re going with this shot... but it''s lacking focus.  What might have gone better was a more macro shot, showing only essences of your different pieces.  Get only the classic jeep grille, maybe the front of the metal detector propped up against the grile.  The camera can be sitting on the bumper, the ski creating an interesting X element on the other side of the grille.  Maybe the backpack sitting on top of the hood with a few straps hanging down into the frame.  I liked that you tried to get all of your hobbies together in one shot, but the problem is the overemphasis of the jeep.  It looks like a picture of the jeep (from a bad angle), with a few random things leaning on it.  Cheers mate.', '2012-07-31 14:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831527, 1027207, 142473, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful capture.  Makes you really wonder...  Quite a nice enigmatic shot.</td>', 'What a wonderful capture.  Makes you really wonder...  Quite a nice enigmatic shot.', '2012-07-31 14:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831530, 1027185, 142473, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing this is a good bit of light painting.  But it''s quite disconnected feeling.  I imagine it could be put together better in the frame, while still showing that you are not put together yourself.</td>', 'I''m guessing this is a good bit of light painting.  But it''s quite disconnected feeling.  I imagine it could be put together better in the frame, while still showing that you are not put together yourself.', '2012-07-31 14:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831532, 1027079, 142473, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully simple.  I like the blown out table with the hint of wood grain.  Almost looks studio.</td>', 'Wonderfully simple.  I like the blown out table with the hint of wood grain.  Almost looks studio.', '2012-07-31 14:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831533, 1026653, 142473, '<td valign="top">So you have a Gorilla head?  Nice.</td>', 'So you have a Gorilla head?  Nice.', '2012-07-31 14:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831535, 1027261, 142473, '<td valign="top">You and me brother.  Really made me smile.  What''s not to like about a classic lego man.</td>', 'You and me brother.  Really made me smile.  What''s not to like about a classic lego man.', '2012-07-31 14:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831536, 1027134, 142473, '<td valign="top">Well done.  Long exposures can be hard to get right.  You seem to have had just the right amount of light.</td>', 'Well done.  Long exposures can be hard to get right.  You seem to have had just the right amount of light.', '2012-07-31 14:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831538, 1026474, 142473, '<td valign="top">The morning sunrise was shadowed by the slowly approaching alien craft...</td>', 'The morning sunrise was shadowed by the slowly approaching alien craft...', '2012-07-31 14:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831539, 1027298, 142473, '<td valign="top">Great colors.  I have a weak spot for blues and yellows together... especially these blues and yellows.  Gorgeous... I need to live there.</td>', 'Great colors.  I have a weak spot for blues and yellows together... especially these blues and yellows.  Gorgeous... I need to live there.', '2012-07-31 14:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831540, 1027218, 142473, '<td valign="top">Poor cabby... he never had a chance against the play-dough witch.</td>', 'Poor cabby... he never had a chance against the play-dough witch.', '2012-07-31 14:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831748, 1027153, 96751, '<td valign="top">Enzo? Gorgeous dish :-)</td>', 'Enzo? Gorgeous dish :-)', '2012-07-31 22:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831925, 1027283, 30982, '<td valign="top">You''re a colorful artistic type who likes to arrange things rather than take things as you find them.</td>', 'You''re a colorful artistic type who likes to arrange things rather than take things as you find them.', '2012-08-01 00:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831927, 1027247, 30982, '<td valign="top">You are a creative soul with a sharp eye for detail.  Lovely clarity and color to this!</td>', 'You are a creative soul with a sharp eye for detail.  Lovely clarity and color to this!', '2012-08-01 00:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831929, 1026638, 30982, '<td valign="top">You''re a free spirit - go where the wind takes you.</td>', 'You''re a free spirit - go where the wind takes you.', '2012-08-01 00:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831931, 1027043, 30982, '<td valign="top">Hi Celeste!  You were much more meticulous about how you set your biek up against the background.  I think that shows a greater care to your photography than I take with mine.  You''ve really really become quite the semi-pro these days!  Your cycling photography is excellent.  This is a very fitting self-portrait.</td>', 'Hi Celeste!  You were much more meticulous about how you set your biek up against the background.  I think that shows a greater care to your photography than I take with mine.  You''ve really really become quite the semi-pro these days!  Your cycling photography is excellent.  This is a very fitting self-portrait.', '2012-08-01 00:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831933, 1027295, 30982, '<td valign="top">This makes me think either you''re a kind and gentle old soul (with or without the big nose) or you had a great shot of an elephant and figured it would suit this challenge nicely.  :-)</td>', 'This makes me think either you''re a kind and gentle old soul (with or without the big nose) or you had a great shot of an elephant and figured it would suit this challenge nicely.  :-)', '2012-08-01 00:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831974, 1027192, 30982, '<td valign="top">Cute little guy - what the heck is he?  You have a knack for making the wildlife pose for you it seems!</td>', 'Cute little guy - what the heck is he?  You have a knack for making the wildlife pose for you it seems!', '2012-08-01 01:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831977, 1027300, 30982, '<td valign="top">From this, I''d say you''re a quiet but determined person who sees the beauty in nature that many might miss.</td>', 'From this, I''d say you''re a quiet but determined person who sees the beauty in nature that many might miss.', '2012-08-01 01:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831978, 1026918, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love flowers in B&amp;W - there''s something very stately and elegant about them when they''re not all dressed up in their colors.  I''d say this indicates a photographer who sees the true essence of a scene, not just the initial trappings.</td>', 'I love flowers in B&W - there''s something very stately and elegant about them when they''re not all dressed up in their colors.  I''d say this indicates a photographer who sees the true essence of a scene, not just the initial trappings.', '2012-08-01 01:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831979, 1026498, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love the misty appearance of the water!  From this I''d say you''re a quiet sort, who likes slipping away with your camera to see what nature has to offer on any given day.</td>', 'Love the misty appearance of the water!  From this I''d say you''re a quiet sort, who likes slipping away with your camera to see what nature has to offer on any given day.', '2012-08-01 01:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831982, 1027251, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ha!  You are creative, driven, and very focused on attention to detail in your work.  But you still know how to have fun.</td>', 'Ha!  You are creative, driven, and very focused on attention to detail in your work.  But you still know how to have fun.', '2012-08-01 01:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831985, 1027176, 30982, '<td valign="top">An interesting way to express yourself!  Have fun with the learning process - find what you enjoy and shoot as often as you can!</td>', 'An interesting way to express yourself!  Have fun with the learning process - find what you enjoy and shoot as often as you can!', '2012-08-01 01:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831987, 1027279, 30982, '<td valign="top">This says to me you''re an animal lover, and enjoy taking pictures of animals.  Or you had a great picture of a cute puppy and figured this would be a good challenge for it!  :-)</td>', 'This says to me you''re an animal lover, and enjoy taking pictures of animals.  Or you had a great picture of a cute puppy and figured this would be a good challenge for it!  :-)', '2012-08-01 01:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831988, 1026734, 30982, '<td valign="top">From this I would assume you''re a lover of the great outdoors and very much enjoy spending time there.</td>', 'From this I would assume you''re a lover of the great outdoors and very much enjoy spending time there.', '2012-08-01 01:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831991, 1027296, 30982, '<td valign="top">What an exceptional macro!  From this (and your title) I would assume you see your role as a parent as prominent, but I''d also take away from this that you are very attentive to detail, very well organized, and a very good photographer.</td>', 'What an exceptional macro!  From this (and your title) I would assume you see your role as a parent as prominent, but I''d also take away from this that you are very attentive to detail, very well organized, and a very good photographer.', '2012-08-01 01:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831995, 1027210, 30982, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot - love the busy-ness of the pines behind and how they enhance rather than detract.  As a self-portrait, I''d take away from this that you are a dedicated nature photographer and very much in your element waiting for the perfect shot - like this one - to come along.</td>', 'Awesome shot - love the busy-ness of the pines behind and how they enhance rather than detract.  As a self-portrait, I''d take away from this that you are a dedicated nature photographer and very much in your element waiting for the perfect shot - like this one - to come along.', '2012-08-01 01:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6831998, 1027217, 30982, '<td valign="top">From this, I''d guess you''re a gatekeeper of sorts - a buffer between people who disagree, or a caregiver, for instance.</td>', 'From this, I''d guess you''re a gatekeeper of sorts - a buffer between people who disagree, or a caregiver, for instance.', '2012-08-01 01:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6832000, 1026925, 30982, '<td valign="top">From this, I''d say you lean toward the graphic artist kind of photographer, who likes strong from and shape in your work.</td>', 'From this, I''d say you lean toward the graphic artist kind of photographer, who likes strong from and shape in your work.', '2012-08-01 01:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6832001, 1027136, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ah, a sort of literal interpretation!  You see yourself as a very strong, supporting kind of person, and perhaps one who prefers to stay in the shadows rather than step into the light.</td>', 'Ah, a sort of literal interpretation!  You see yourself as a very strong, supporting kind of person, and perhaps one who prefers to stay in the shadows rather than step into the light.', '2012-08-01 01:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6832006, 1026779, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m going to guess this is our very own Bear Music, and a very fitting "self portrait" - your range extends far beyond this, but this suits so very nicely.</td>', 'I''m going to guess this is our very own Bear Music, and a very fitting "self portrait" - your range extends far beyond this, but this suits so very nicely.', '2012-08-01 01:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6832010, 1027269, 30982, '<td valign="top">A nice collection!  I''m particularly envious of the Jeep.  :-)  From this I see that you primarily prefer to be outside whenever possible.</td>', 'A nice collection!  I''m particularly envious of the Jeep.  :-)  From this I see that you primarily prefer to be outside whenever possible.', '2012-08-01 01:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6832013, 1027115, 30982, '<td valign="top">From this I would think you''re a quiet person who pays great attention to intricate detail.  Or you''re a nature photographer.  Maybe both!</td>', 'From this I would think you''re a quiet person who pays great attention to intricate detail.  Or you''re a nature photographer.  Maybe both!', '2012-08-01 01:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6832015, 1026459, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!  A very attentive model you have there!  I like the added touch of the remote control, too.</td>', 'Heh!  A very attentive model you have there!  I like the added touch of the remote control, too.', '2012-08-01 01:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
