(6833068, 1026685, 30982, '<td valign="top">This makes me smile, though my sentiment may not be what you''ve intended.  It is a bland scene, with little to recommend it.  The colors are washed out, as Lensbaby colors often are.  Yet if one squints just so, one can see the potential here.  A quiet spot of respite, perhaps a small garden awaits.  Hence, your title.  You are perhaps someone who sees what might exist, rather than being swayed by what doesn''t.</td>', 'This makes me smile, though my sentiment may not be what you''ve intended.  It is a bland scene, with little to recommend it.  The colors are washed out, as Lensbaby colors often are.  Yet if one squints just so, one can see the potential here.  A quiet spot of respite, perhaps a small garden awaits.  Hence, your title.  You are perhaps someone who sees what might exist, rather than being swayed by what doesn''t.', '2012-08-01 23:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
